# Responsibilities: Exclude local secrets, datasets and GPU resources from the Docker build context.
# Implementation: Filter before any bytes are sent to the engine; Dockerfile copies application dirs.
# Related Modules: deploy/standalone/Dockerfile; root .gitignore protects local deployment state.
# Declaration Index: None.
# Variable Index: Patterns below exclude runtime state and optional resource-heavy components.
.git
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/server_info.txt
**/.deploy
**/.venv
**/.runtime
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.sqlite3*
**/*.log
**/.capacity
**/test-results
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
DigitalHuman
training
security_evaluation
docs
output
rag/data/raw
rag/data/clean
rag/data/chunks
rag/data/embeddings
rag/data/models
rag/data/reports
